# Where the dashboard should find the API.
#
# Leave this UNSET for the normal offline / LAN install. The ready-to-run server serves the
# dashboard and the API together from one address, so the dashboard connects to whichever
# computer served the page. This is what makes it work on the server itself and on every
# other computer on the network, with no configuration.
#
# Set it to an absolute URL ONLY when you host the dashboard somewhere away from its API,
# for example a copy deployed to Vercel. Vite inlines this at build time, so the value must
# be present when `npm run build` runs.
#
#   VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://mdm-api.example.go.ug
#
# Note: a browser on the public internet can only reach an API that is itself published
# (HTTPS required). Agents on the district LAN keep using their own address regardless.
